00:13:57,940 --> 00:14:22,620
In the paragraphs, the stated main idea is called topic sentence. So when I tell you what is topic sentence, it means the sentence that gives the main idea of the paragraph. If it is an article, like more formal writing, we call it thesis statement in essays, in articles. Okay?

